  m_text: 'Speedster Trait :

    Unlockable with 4 8 or 12 cards in deck

    Tiers
    unlock when attacking with ally speedster units (4/8/10 Times)

    Tier 1 :
    All speedster units you summon have +1 ATK

    Tier 2 : All speedster units
    you summon have quickstrike

    Tier 3 : All UNITS gain quickstrike and +1 ATK
