  m_text: 'Healer Trait :

    Unlockable with 6 9 or 14 cards in deck

    Tiers
    unlock when healing allies (overheal doesn''t count) (5,10,20 hp)

    Tier 1
    : Your heals heal 2 more HP for the rest of the game.

    Tier 2 : Your heals
    heal 3 more HP for the rest of the game.

    Tier 3 : Your heals deal damage
    when targetting enemies this game.'
