  m_text: 'Pokemon Trait :

    Unlockable with 4 8 or 12 cards in deck

    Tiers
    unlock when killing enemy units 3/6/10 Times in the game with pokemon

    First
    tier makes the next played pokemon evolve

    Second tier makes the next played
    pokemon evolve with +2/+2 in stats

    Third tier allows the player to discover
    a LEGENDARY pokemon'
