  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Neutral Trait :

    Unlockable with 4 8 or 12 cards in deck

    Tiers
    unlock when playing neutral cards 3/6/12 times during the game

    First tier
    grants the first played neutral unit each turn +1 hp

    Second tier makes the
    first drawn neutral card cost 1 less if it cost 3 or more

    Third tier draw
    an extra card on turn start'
