  m_text: 'Avatar Trait :

    Unlockable with 5, 10 or 15  Avatar cards in deck.

    Tiers
    unlock when praising the avatar with the "praise" effect (4/8/12 times).

    Tier
    1 : Shuffle the two avatars into your deck.

    Tier 2 : Your avatars unlock
    their elements (in hand or deck).

    Tier 3 : Your avatars enter AVATAR STATE
    (in hand or deck).'
